<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Lawyer Application Update</title>

```
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f7f7f7;
    color: #333333;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 30px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #222222;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .reason {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background-color: #fdf2f2;
    border-left: 4px solid #e02424;
    color: #611a15;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding-top: 15px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #888888;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
```

  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Lawyer Application Update</h2>

```
  <p>
    Hello <%= name %>,
  </p>

  <p>
    Thank you for applying to become a lawyer on
    <strong>Justice Desk</strong>.
  </p>

  <p>
    After carefully reviewing your application, we are unable to approve
    your lawyer application at this time.
  </p>

  <% if (reason) { %>
    <div class="reason">
      <strong>Reason:</strong>
      <%= reason %>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <p>
    You may review the information provided in your application and
    contact Justice Desk support if you believe this decision was made
    in error.
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Justice Desk.
    All rights reserved.
  </div>
</div>
```

  </body>
</html>
